{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 9,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 360.283,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 9.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was a voice heard among all the inhabitants of the earth, upon all the face of this land, crying:",
      "verse": "9:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 9.689,
      "end": 11.918,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo, wo, wo unto this people;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 12.098,
      "end": 17.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wo unto the inhabitants of the whole earth except they shall repent;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 17.34,
      "end": 24.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the devil laugheth, and his angels rejoice, because of the slain of the fair sons and daughters of my people;",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 24.44,
      "end": 29.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is because of their iniquity and abominations that they are fallen!",
      "verse": "9:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 30.136,
      "end": 34.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, that great city Zarahemla have I burned with fire,",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 34.356,
      "end": 36.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof.",
      "verse": "9:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 37.126,
      "end": 39.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, that great city Moroni",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 39.674,
      "end": 43.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have I caused to be sunk in the depths of the sea,",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 43.198,
      "end": 45.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof to be drowned.",
      "verse": "9:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 46.432,
      "end": 50.519,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, that great city Moronihah have I covered with earth,",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 50.699,
      "end": 52.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof,",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 52.876,
      "end": 57.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to hide their iniquities and their abominations from before my face,",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 57.561,
      "end": 60.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the blood of the prophets and the saints",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 60.388,
      "end": 63.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall not come any more unto me against them.",
      "verse": "9:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 63.947,
      "end": 67.802,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the city of Gilgal have I caused to be sunk,",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 67.982,
      "end": 73.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof to be buried up in the depths of the earth;",
      "verse": "9:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 73.863,
      "end": 80.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and the city of Onihah and the inhabitants thereof, and the city of Mocum and the inhabitants thereof,",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 80.684,
      "end": 84.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the city of Jerusalem and the inhabitants thereof;",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 84.208,
      "end": 88.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and waters have I caused to come up in the stead thereof,",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 88.66,
      "end": 92.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to hide their wickedness and abominations from before my face,",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 93.112,
      "end": 95.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the blood of the prophets and the saints",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 95.939,
      "end": 99.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall not come up any more unto me against them.",
      "verse": "9:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 99.684,
      "end": 101.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the city of Gadiandi,",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 102.14,
      "end": 104.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the city of Gadiomnah,",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 104.224,
      "end": 107.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the city of Jacob, and the city of Gimgimno,",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 107.655,
      "end": 109.977,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all these have I caused to be sunk,",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 110.157,
      "end": 113.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and made hills and valleys in the places thereof;",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 113.82,
      "end": 123.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof have I buried up in the depths of the earth, to hide their wickedness and abominations from before my face,",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 123.334,
      "end": 125.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the blood of the prophets and the saints",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 126.161,
      "end": 129.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should not come up any more unto me against them.",
      "verse": "9:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 130.185,
      "end": 132.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, that great city Jacobugath,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 133.151,
      "end": 136.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was inhabited by the people of king Jacob,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 136.489,
      "end": 141.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have I caused to be burned with fire because of their sins and their wickedness,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 141.824,
      "end": 148.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was above all the wickedness of the whole earth, because of their secret murders and combinations;",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 149.016,
      "end": 152.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was they that did destroy the peace of my people",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 152.54,
      "end": 154.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the government of the land;",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 155.042,
      "end": 157.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I did cause them to be burned,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 157.869,
      "end": 160.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to destroy them from before my face,",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 160.557,
      "end": 163.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the blood of the prophets and the saints",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 163.384,
      "end": 166.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should not come up unto me any more against them.",
      "verse": "9:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 167.129,
      "end": 171.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the city of Laman, and the city of Josh,",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 171.21,
      "end": 175.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the city of Gad, and the city of Kishkumen,",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 175.523,
      "end": 178.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have I caused to be burned with fire,",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 178.211,
      "end": 183.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof, because of their wickedness in casting out the prophets,",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 183.453,
      "end": 191.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stoning those whom I did send to declare unto them concerning their wickedness and their abominations.",
      "verse": "9:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 191.796,
      "end": 194.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because they did cast them all out,",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 194.344,
      "end": 196.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that there were none righteous among them,",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 197.078,
      "end": 199.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I did send down fire and destroy them,",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 199.905,
      "end": 205.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that their wickedness and abominations might be hid from before my face,",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 205.658,
      "end": 209.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the blood of the prophets and the saints whom I sent among them",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 210.11,
      "end": 213.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "might not cry unto me from the ground against them.",
      "verse": "9:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 213.994,
      "end": 223.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many great destructions have I caused to come upon this land, and upon this people, because of their wickedness and their abominations.",
      "verse": "9:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 224.148,
      "end": 228.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O all ye that are spared because ye were more righteous than they,",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 228.461,
      "end": 230.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will ye not now return unto me,",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 230.917,
      "end": 233.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and repent of your sins, and be converted,",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 233.883,
      "end": 235.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may heal you?",
      "verse": "9:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 236.188,
      "end": 238.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, verily I say unto you,",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 238.504,
      "end": 241.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye will come unto me ye shall have eternal life.",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 241.842,
      "end": 245.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, mine arm of mercy is extended towards you,",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 245.366,
      "end": 248.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whosoever will come, him will I receive;",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 248.24,
      "end": 250.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and blessed are those who come unto me.",
      "verse": "9:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 251.381,
      "end": 253.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am Jesus Christ the Son of God.",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 254.162,
      "end": 256.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I created the heavens and the earth,",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 256.803,
      "end": 259.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all things that in them are.",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 259.351,
      "end": 261.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I was with the Father from the beginning.",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 261.807,
      "end": 264.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am in the Father, and the Father in me;",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 264.681,
      "end": 267.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in me hath the Father glorified his name.",
      "verse": "9:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 267.776,
      "end": 270.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I came unto my own, and my own received me not.",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 271.114,
      "end": 274.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the scriptures concerning my coming are fulfilled.",
      "verse": "9:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 274.813,
      "end": 276.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as many as have received me,",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 277.176,
      "end": 280.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to them have I given to become the sons of God;",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 280.56,
      "end": 284.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even so will I to as many as shall believe on my name,",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 284.687,
      "end": 287.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, by me redemption cometh,",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 287.561,
      "end": 290.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in me is the law of Moses fulfilled.",
      "verse": "9:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 290.981,
      "end": 293.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am the light and the life of the world.",
      "verse": "9:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 293.669,
      "end": 297.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am Alpha and Omega, the beginning and the end.",
      "verse": "9:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 297.832,
      "end": 301.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye shall offer up unto me no more the shedding of blood;",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 301.634,
      "end": 305.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, your sacrifices and your burnt offerings shall be done away,",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 305.529,
      "end": 310.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I will accept none of your sacrifices and your burnt offerings.",
      "verse": "9:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 310.853,
      "end": 315.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And ye shall offer for a sacrifice unto me a broken heart and a contrite spirit.",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 316.049,
      "end": 320.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whoso cometh unto me with a broken heart and a contrite spirit,",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 320.501,
      "end": 323.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "him will I baptize with fire and with the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 324.164,
      "end": 328.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as the Lamanites, because of their faith in me at the time of their conversion,",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 328.942,
      "end": 332.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were baptized with fire and with the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 332.326,
      "end": 333.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they knew it not.",
      "verse": "9:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 334.678,
      "end": 341.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I have come unto the world to bring redemption unto the world, to save the world from sin.",
      "verse": "9:21",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 341.813,
      "end": 346.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, whoso repenteth and cometh unto me as a little child, him will I receive,",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 346.73,
      "end": 349.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for of such is the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 349.278,
      "end": 351.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, for such I have laid down my life,",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 352.152,
      "end": 354.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have taken it up again;",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 354.19,
      "end": 355.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore repent,",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 355.81,
      "end": 359.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come unto me ye ends of the earth, and be saved.",
      "verse": "9:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    }
  ]
}